What is here
- gdn_forward.cu: the CUDA (non-TileLang) SM70 GDN kernels. vLLM-sm70
  keeps the varlen chunked prefill against the [N, Hv, V, K] state layout
  and the fused mixed-QKV decode against vLLM's global state slots. The
  DDTree decode, the fixed-batch forward and the pybind11 module were
  removed, and the ops are registered with TORCH_LIBRARY_FRAGMENT in the
  _sm70_C namespace. PROVENANCE.md lists every change.
